            Sign in from the Slack desktop app

            The Slack app on this Mac is signed in to these workspaces. Pick one:

            > Alpha
              Beta
              Gamma

            Up/Down or j/k to choose, Enter to sign in, p to paste a browser request
            instead.

            macOS will ask whether slakio may use the "Slack Safe Storage" key: choose
            Allow. slakio reads the Slack app's files and changes nothing; the sign-in
            goes to the macOS Keychain.

            Ctrl+Q  Quit
            ?       Keyboard help







 NORMAL                                           │ Cmd+V paste · Ctrl+Q quit · ? help · : commands
